<!--
  PLAIN-ENGLISH GUIDE
  WHAT THIS FILE IS: every English text the app shows. The code never writes
  words directly; it asks for R.string.name and Android picks this file (English)
  or values-es/strings.xml (Spanish) based on the phone's language.
  TO CHANGE A TEXT: edit it here AND the same name in values-es/strings.xml.
   %1$d = a whole number filled in by the code; %1$s = a piece of text.
   &amp; = the & sign; \' = an apostrophe (XML needs these written specially).
   "plurals" pick "1 day" vs "2 days" automatically.
-->
