    <string name="credits_body">• Online food data: Open Food Facts (openfoodfacts.org), © Open Food Facts contributors, under the Open Database License (ODbL).\n• Online recipes: TheMealDB (themealdb.com). The free key is for personal use; publishing the app needs their supporter key.\n• Built-in food values: standard nutrition reference figures (USDA FoodData Central style). Facts, not copied text.\n• Exercise estimates: MET values from the Compendium of Physical Activities.\n• Built-in recipes, texts and the app icon are original to Gym &amp; Ñam. Food icons are your phone’s emoji.\n• Open-source libraries: Kotlin, AndroidX/Jetpack (Compose, Room, CameraX, WorkManager, Glance, Biometric, Health Connect) and ZXing, under the Apache License 2.0.</string>
